{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step behind the curtain of <i>Flesh Made Fear</i> and explore the twisted world of Rotwood in this official digital artbook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Flesh Made Fear: Art of Rotwood</i></strong> offers a detailed look at the game\u2019s visual evolution \u2014 from early sketches and rough concepts to final in-game environments. Inside you\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character designs and creature studies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D models and prop breakdowns</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds, lighting tests, and moodshots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each page reflects the creative process behind the nightmare. The sketches, the mistakes, and the moments where the horror took shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A must-have for fans of dark art and anyone curious how fear is built, frame by frame.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108320?t=1761922807","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108320/f86bb0b8fa466875466797fcdccd09ea06857eee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761922807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108320/323bd95d447decaeb3fdaa185336da92b5bf5dca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761922807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108320/323bd95d447decaeb3fdaa185336da92b5bf5dca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761922807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}